# Cyclops, Starsoul Magician

> Cyclops is a mid laner whose damage ceiling is not a stat but a cooldown equation. Every skill hit shortens every other cooldown, so a Cyclops who lands everything casts twice as often as one who whiffs. Played to that loop he is a relentless poke engine; without it he is a short-range immobile mage with only Flicker to escape.

