## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Cooldown Default (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy, Genius Wand, Divine Glaive, Glowing Wand
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy, Genius Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Wishing Lantern over Glowing Wand when Use when the enemy front line has high HP but little healing or shielding to punish.; Blood Wings over Glowing Wand when Use when you are ahead and need the shield plus movement speed to keep cycling spells safely.; Winter Crown over Glowing Wand when Use when one assassin or hard-engage combo can reach you before Flicker creates enough space.; Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use only against low-Magic-Defense drafts where early flat penetration matters more than cooldown tempo.
- Total cost: 10820 gold

Default mid setup that turns Cyclops into a cooldown loop after Enchanted Talisman, then adds sustain and penetration for repeated skirmishes.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Thrill, Seasoned Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Genius Wand over Wishing Lantern when Use when your lanes are winning early and repeated flat Magic Defense shred will decide the first two objectives.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use when enemy healing, shielding, or HP-stacking frontliners are surviving through your second rotation.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when the enemy can invade and burst you before Ice Retribution or Planets Attack creates distance.; Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when your jungle path is protected and early kill pressure matters more than maximum cooldown cycling.
- Total cost: 11120 gold

Jungle setup for games where Cyclops is allowed to farm quickly, contest objectives with Retribution, and chase with Ice Retribution plus S2 speed.

### Anti-Dive Control (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand, Divine Glaive, Winter Crown
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is damage-heavy but does not have enough crowd control to justify Fortitude.; Genius Wand over Winter Crown when Use when your front line is protecting you and the fight needs faster Magic Defense shred instead of a stasis active.; Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when poke and chase damage threaten you more than a single all-in engage.; Wishing Lantern over Winter Crown when Use when HP-stacking targets are the main problem and your positioning is safe enough to skip stasis.
- Total cost: 10720 gold

Defensive mid setup for CC-heavy or dive-heavy drafts where Cyclops must survive the first lockout before his cooldown loop can take over.

